[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5714400190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123560#issuecomment-5714400190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123560","id":5714400190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVJrTvg","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T12:32:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T12:32:44Z","body":"Since these methods are added for consistency with other nodes that use packed arrays (e.g. Line2D), shouldn't the parameter order also be consistent? (e.g. `set_point_position()` takes index first, position second)\r\n\r\nThat would mean adding a whole new method, and likely deprecating and replacing the old one, but it might be overall better.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5714400190/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5716691945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123560#issuecomment-5716691945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123560","id":5716691945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVL3L6Q","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T15:10:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T15:21:26Z","body":"If the order changes then I won't be able to have index 0 as the default value anymore, which is extremely common. Most uses only have 2 children so its helpful if users don't need to care what index it is.\r\nI would also have to update how it is already used around 30 places all over the editor (and more in tests).\r\n\r\nEdit: To me its not really for consistency, its just to make it easier to set the split offset for SplitContainer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5716691945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]